  "details": "I was working on a editor script to share and browse through community made collision tags and wanted to integrate the UI for that right into the contact senders and receivers. However I had to discover, that those editor scripts (the ones deriving from UnityEditor.Editor) are not exposed at all, making it A: impossible to modify them and B: impossible to expand on them. There are some janky alternative ways for me to access them, but if those scripts were not hidden in DLLs, that would be greatly appreciated.\nThe project I am working on is visible here:\nUnity Scripts:\nhttps://github.com/TayouVR/VRChatCollisionTagExplorer\nSample Database:\nhttps://github.com/TayouVR/VRChatCollisionTagDatabase\nPS: This could be a package for the VPM later down the line too. :)",
